<p>NOTE: All performance ratios are calculated to exclude the effect of non- recurring items and annualized for the three month periods as appropriate.</p>
<p>The results for the full year were adversely affected by a one-time charge to record a charitable donation of 671,046 shares of common stock to the Ocean Federal Foundation with a market value of $13.4 million ($9.7 million after tax) and a non- recurring charge of $5.7 million ($3.7 million after tax), representing the Bank's share of a special assessment required of all institutions insured by the Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).  Both charges were incurred in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
